		README.pdpstdio 1.0 (2.11BSD) 2025/12/26

The files in stdio/ were written for the old stdio but not adapted to the new
ANSI compliant stdio package

The files in stdio/ are being retained for reference. 

It is not likely that rewriting the routines in stdio/ for the new stdio 
will save much space but there might be a minor speed improvement.
